{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_ccheal_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_ccheal_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "學醫之路",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ccheal_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c1fa2d68c1b3a353be5c30d96abd7896069cf1599af1129cea2bc1a22aebcfe3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_deserttownD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，嘉維爾醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我感覺自己好點了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我能做的也只有這麼多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，反正礦石病也治不好，能多活久一點是一點吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我初來乍到，想知道這座城裡有對礦石病有研究的醫生嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣的，幾個月前，有個薩卡茲醫生來了這裡，買下了西邊的一片廢墟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，她放出消息，說她有能夠治療礦石病的特製糖果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要願意讓她抽一管血，她就會把糖果給患者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……有人相信這種話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來是沒有的，但是有人病急亂投醫，把孩子送過去之後，孩子的症狀真的好轉了，於是，逐漸開始有越來越多的人相信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來，事情到這裡也就結束了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，最近貧民窟裡有傳聞，好像有個孩子失蹤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失蹤……你們猜是那個醫生做的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後一個看到那個孩子的人說，她去了那個醫生那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼不去找那個醫生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我們不敢。據去過那裡的人說，那個醫生的房間裡到處是血袋……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且她的態度也很兇惡，看起來像是隨時都有可能突然殺人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼不告訴王酋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……因為失蹤的只是個無家可歸的孩子，老爺們根本不願意管這種事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然這樣，我去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貧民窟居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的要去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我要去看看，那個醫生是不是真的有治療礦石病的本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是假的，而且是那個人綁架了孩子，我一定會讓她受到懲罰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_storehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "房間十分破敗，剛踏入的時候，嘉維爾甚至懷疑自己來錯了地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對，有一股味道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她剛邁開腳步，就好像踢到了什麼東西。\n她低頭看去——\n那是一隻鞋子，從尺寸來看，毫無疑問，是孩子的。\n而鞋子的旁邊，有一灘血跡。\n她頓時感到毛骨悚然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這裡，究竟發生了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她蹲下身，仔細嗅了嗅血跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是貨真價實的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道說，真的有一個孩子死在這裡了嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她馬上注意到，血跡的旁邊，有一顆糖果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是那個醫生發給孩子們的糖果嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這……根本就是普通的糖果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用這些糖果欺騙孩子們……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嘉維爾抬頭看去，一個女孩，正站在二樓的樓梯口，發愣地看著她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小朋友，能不能告訴我，這裡發生了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到底是怎麼回事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_u"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼又回來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小朋友，別怕，我是來救你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……你就是這裡的醫生嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嘉維爾來不及為房間中掛著的血袋感到吃驚，因為，在她面前的，是一個白髮紅瞳的薩卡茲。\n她突然想起自己在通識書上讀到過的內容——血魔。\n他們是薩卡茲的分支，十分強大，但也臭名昭著。\n他們行走於陰影之中，以他人的血液為食，殺人如麻、無惡不作……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是……血魔？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此，你用糖果誘騙城裡的孩子，就是為了把他們變成你的食物對吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你又是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫嘉維爾，是個醫生，我今天就是來揭穿你的邪惡陰謀的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我現在沒空對付你，先睡一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……你對我……做了什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "調整了一下你的血液循環而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乖乖睡一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……我感覺我的身體好像在燃燒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？中了我的源石技藝居然沒有馬上倒下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真有趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過了……我叫……嘉維爾……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……是個醫生……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來救這個孩子——呃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然掙脫了，這真是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這真是越來越有趣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼獲得她的血好呢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放開那個孩子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈……那就這麼辦吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只見血魔將手拂過女孩的頭頂，女孩立刻失去知覺，緩緩倒在血魔的腳邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你對那個孩子做了什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她將作為我的糧食被保存在這裡，放心吧，她不會感到痛苦的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你這混蛋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你想救她的話，那就和她交換吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交換？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，你來代替她接受抽血，這樣，我就放過她，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？這麼爽快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是在這裡和你大打出手，我怕傷到那個孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你要說話算話，放她離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……否則，就算我今天死在這裡，我也絕不會放過你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要如何不放過我？你馬上就要死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "部族裡的祭司爺爺說過，阿卡胡拉的勇士死後，靈魂會回歸阿卡胡拉的湖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“我的靈魂經過湖水的洗滌，會融入林間的風，會化作天上的雨。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該害怕的是你，可惡的血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當風刮過你的臉龐，當雨水淋在你的肩頭時，你就會想起我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩爾貢的部族之間真是有不少有趣的傳承。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜，你不瞭解血魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "風在我的身邊會被血腥的味道驅散，而雨在我的頭頂也會化作血液融入我的身體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的靈魂，傷不了我一絲一毫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嘉維爾憤怒地閉上了眼，準備迎接自己的死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "還沒離開雨林時，嘉維爾一直以為，最刺眼的東西，是太陽。\n有一次，她鼓起勇氣想要直視太陽，結果眼睛被曬傷，好幾天看東西都帶著重影。\n應該沒有比太陽更刺眼的東西了，她想。\n但是，離開雨林後，她發現自己錯了。\n最刺眼的東西，其實是其他人的目光……是其他人看向她身上源石結晶的目光。\n她不害怕這些目光中蘊含的惡意，但是，每當她想要直視這些目光時，目光的主人就會移開視線。\n她花了一段時間才明白，原來，自己得的病不叫“石頭病”而叫“礦石病”；原來，自己這樣的人被叫作“感染者”。\n原來，礦石病被認為是不治之症。\n原來，感染者的生活大多很糟糕。\n在雨林裡，明明沒有這樣的區別，大家也不會歧視得了礦石病的人。\n她想不清楚為什麼，她只知道，即使是不治之症，如果能讓礦石病人好過一點，或許就能讓他們的處境好一些。\n於是她四處尋找，尋找那些自稱有辦法對付礦石病的醫生，想要從他們身上尋求方法。\n但每一次的尋求，最終帶給她的都是失望。\n他們有的只是沽名釣譽，有的更是藉著治療感染者的名義做著違法的勾當。\n而她明明只是指出了這一點，反而被他們誣陷，一度成為通緝犯。\n為什麼呢？\n…………\n她感到針管插入手臂帶來的些微疼痛，隨之而來的，是血液被抽離的喪失感。\n哦對了，阿卡胡拉的夥伴們還不知道她的身上發生了什麼呢。\n早知道，應該先回去看她們一眼的。\n喪失感很快就結束了。\n然後是一片沉寂。\n這就是死亡嗎？\n血魔殺人的方法原來是無痛的嗎……\n………………\n…………\n……\n不對，她並沒有死？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_u"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……雖然你血液中的源石結晶密度不低，但是你的血液狀態很健康。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然，你的身體機能遠超常人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不殺我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我為什麼要殺你？我說的是，讓你代替她接受抽血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你不是，血魔……抽血不就是……殺人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的同族確實有不少人喜歡這麼做，但我沒這個興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你為什麼要這麼做？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛才靠意志力掙脫了我的源石技藝，我對你的血很感興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，要和你戰鬥大概很麻煩，所以臨時想了這個辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邪惡的血魔",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你的配合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你到底是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫華法琳，是個醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小朋友，醒醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大姐姐，你也是來治病的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是來找你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外面的人都以為你失蹤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生告訴我，我太虛弱了，讓我先靜養，我就沒有出門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你真的沒有騙人……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些人連血魔可以成為醫生都不相信，你無法說服這樣的人去相信超出他們想像的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……你不去澄清嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在幾百年前就已經不關心其他人的看法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有時間做這種事，我情願多做一些血液研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，謝謝你，我感覺好多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你給我血，我給你藥，各取所需而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們該回去了，別打擾我進行研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者孩童",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，醫生再見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，那些糖果——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那確實是普通的糖果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，只要患者相信它有效果，它就會有效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在醫學上，這叫作“安慰劑”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，這不是等同於欺騙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你能給出特效藥嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "礦石病是不治之症，如果欺騙能讓患者多活一段時間，我找不到不這麼做的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "治療的目的是減輕病人的痛苦，只要能夠達成治療目的，別說欺騙了，就是成為惡魔又怎麼樣呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，我也不期望你能夠理解我的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你走吧，別再來打擾我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此，太有道理了，醫生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你相信嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，這不是很有道理嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道說你還在騙我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我說的都是真的。只是相信的人不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？我覺得你說得對啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生又不是超人，就算是被記恨，只要能治好病人我就心滿意足了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……沒想到，你居然是一個明白人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "華法琳醫生，不，華法琳大師，我一直在尋找你這樣的，能教授我真正的醫術的醫生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以傳授我醫術嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難得遇到一個你這樣懂我的人，我也不是不能夠教你一些醫術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我又不想讓人打擾我的血液研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是對我的血液感興趣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以讓你抽血！你隨便研究！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這倒是不用，剛才抽的那管血已經夠用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你有什麼需要解決的麻煩，我可以幫你解決！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說來……倒還真有一件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "樣本不夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用糖果換抽血，信的人終歸是少數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有許多感染者並不相信我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加上你剛才說有關我的謠言已經傳開了，恐怕接下來更不會有人來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你來之前，我正盤算著公開自己的身分，恐嚇這裡的居民，好讓我一個個抽血呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得這個方法不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我感覺有點太慢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算加上我有兩個人，要抽那麼多人的血也不輕鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得也有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……有了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這件事交給我吧，大師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我能解決的話，你願意傳授我醫術嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_storehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾天後"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾怎麼一去好幾天都沒有回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道她遇到了什麼麻煩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算她沒有解決這個問題，我也打算教她醫術的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不然，還是去找她吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "華法琳大師！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼才回來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這些血袋是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣的，我平時會在貧民窟義診，那裡的人都願意聽我說兩句話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我告訴他們，你的研究需要一些血液，他們知道後，都願意在力所能及的範圍內捐血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，對了，你可以放心，關於你的傳聞，我也對他們澄清過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣，這些應該夠你研究了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照你給我當參考的樣本，我也已經做好了相應的記錄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是記錄冊，你可以看一看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯，你記錄得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你願意傳授我醫術了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒想到，我居然會在這裡遇到你這樣一個意氣相投，又能做到我做不到的事的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要是早點遇到你，還擔心什麼缺少樣本！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，交給我就對了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，我決定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從今往後，我們可以一起旅行，去研究各地感染者的血液狀況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到時候，就由你來幫我收集血液，而我來研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也會把我知道的醫術都傳授給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要去哪裡，華法琳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什——凱爾希？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是怎麼找到這裡來的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本來就已經鎖定了你潛伏在這一帶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果，聽說這裡有一個醫生，在替人治病的時候，會幫忙宣傳另一名血魔醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得來全不費工夫，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……可惡，忘了你這傢伙的消息靈通得不得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經離開崗位三個月了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我每個月都有寄研究成果給你，也不算是離開崗位吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些事必須要有你在場才能推進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你該回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，是華法琳的同事，我是來帶她回去的。你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫嘉維爾，是個醫生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "華法琳說，如果我幫她的忙，她就願意傳授我醫術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要帶走她嗎？可是，我們剛要啟程——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯！我剛要和嘉維爾開始旅行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "答應你的血庫已經開始建造了，你不是說要親自監督嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你早點告訴我，我早就回去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嘉維爾，看來我們的旅行要暫時擱置了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你們說的羅德島是個什麼樣的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島是一家致力於礦石病治療的製藥公司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那裡面是不是有很多像華法琳一樣，可以教我醫術的人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然華法琳要回去，那我可以跟你們一起去嗎，我也想加入羅德島！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這倒是個辦法。凱爾希，我向你保證，她是個不可多得的人才！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些血袋都是你收集的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這份記錄冊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "華法琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_171_bldsk_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你什麼時候拿過去的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，十分詳細的資料，筆記和總結也都十分到位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然能否加入羅德島還需要經過測試，但是光憑這份記錄，你已經至少可以為自己贏得一份文職的工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我想學醫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你來到羅德島，這樣的機會數不勝數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，在那之前，我有一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你為什麼想要加入羅德島？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那當然是因為，我想要治好所有人的礦石病！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，羅德島歡迎你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
